      "why": "there is no document store. The reference resolves to nothing"
    },
    {
      "inference": "requirement_status_from_this_trail",
      "why": "the current proof status is derived and returned, never written back. Two writers on one column is how the two come to disagree"
    },
    {
      "inference": "deletion_from_rejection_or_supersession",
      "why": "a rejected proof and a superseded one are both retained. An audit trail that can be rewritten is not one"
